1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,024
I bought a perfume that forces obedience. Total, unquestioning compliance. I just wanted my wife to finally listen to me.

2
00:00:09,324 --> 00:00:16,548
Leo sprayed the mist in the hallway right before she walked through the front door, heart hammering in his chest.

3
00:00:16,848 --> 00:00:26,040
Clara stopped dead in her tracks. The cold, distant look in her eyes instantly melted into a blank, glassy stare.

4
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:33,228
It worked. I told her to sit on the couch, and she moved like a puppet with invisible strings pulled tight.

5
00:00:33,528 --> 00:00:41,496
She didn't blink. She just waited for my next command, stripped of every ounce of her stubborn, beautiful fire.

6
00:00:41,796 --> 00:00:49,572
A wave of guilt hit me hard. This wasn't love. This was a cage. I reached out to grab the bottle and reverse it.

7
00:00:49,872 --> 00:00:59,736
Before my fingers touched the glass, Clara spoke. Her voice wasn't robotic anymore. It was sharp, cold, and entirely in control.

8
00:01:00,036 --> 00:01:07,548
Drop the bottle, Leo. You always were so easily manipulated by anything with a nice label on the shelf.

9
00:01:07,848 --> 00:01:15,528
I tried to run, but my legs wouldn't move. My arms locked at my sides. The mist hadn't targeted her at all.

10
00:01:15,828 --> 00:01:25,164
She bought the perfume online yesterday, waiting to see if I was stupid enough to use it on myself. Why is the leash only visible when you try to run?
